  "logicalMainRows": [
    {
      "mainRow": 1,
      "block": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 1,
      "text": "$a_3\\cdots$ 都表示某一个有理数，它可以由这个有理数做除法运算",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 2,
      "block": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 2,
      "text": "得到.",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 3,
      "block": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 1,
      "text": "我们不打算给出这个定理的证明. 后面将介绍怎样化一",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 4,
      "block": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 2,
      "text": "个无穷循环小数（除了循环节 $9$ 的情况外），为一个普通分",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 5,
      "block": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 3,
      "text": "数 $\\frac{m}{n}$：由这个分数做除法运算可以得到给定的无穷循环",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 6,
      "block": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 4,
      "text": "小数.",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 7,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 1,
      "text": "容易明白，为什么自然数 $m$ 除以自然数 $n$ 的结果，不能得到以 $9$ 为",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 8,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 2,
      "text": "循环节的无穷小数，例如：$0.23(9)$. 不然就存在一个有理数 $r=\\frac{m}{n}$ 满",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 9,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 3,
      "text": "足不等式",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 10,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 4,
      "text": "$r<0.24$ 和 $r>0.\\underbrace{2399\\cdots9}_{k\\text{ 位}}$（$k$ 任意），",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 11,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 5,
      "text": "但是这时，由于差",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 12,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 6,
      "text": "$0.24-r$",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 13,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 7,
      "text": "是一个正数，要它小于",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 14,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 8,
      "text": "$0.24-0.\\underbrace{2399\\cdots9}_{k\\text{ 位}}=10^{-k}$（$k$ 任意），",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 15,
      "block": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "lineWithinBlock": 9,
      "text": "是不可能的.",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 16,
      "block": 4,
      "kind": "exhead",
      "lineWithinBlock": 1,
      "text": "习 题",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 17,
      "block": 5,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lineWithinBlock": 1,
      "text": "115. 用无穷小数的形式表示下列各数，并解释为什么这些无",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 18,
      "block": 5,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lineWithinBlock": 2,
      "text": "穷小数是循环小数：",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 19,
      "block": 5,
      "kind": "ex",
      "lineWithinBlock": 3,
      "text": "а) $\\frac{7}{3}$； б) $\\frac{23}{30}$； в) $-\\frac{3}{7}$； г) $-\\frac{29}{11}$.",
      "existingWrapMarkers": 0
    },
    {
      "mainRow": 20,
